comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-19T18:04:41.544Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: request-specific extension author search plus complete 206 open / 3 in-progress lists show no matching active owner. Closed pm-cpja and its full history describe shipped core author support; this report is a new injected-client path under the existing pm-mpbb capability. Original GH report retained; no regression claim is made before reproduction."
  "2026-10-20T06:57:01.782Z","harness:codex","Implementation intake: strict complete CLI read certified all 3021 items (204 open, 59 draft, 2744 closed, 14 canceled), zero unreadable records and no omitted metadata. No prior active claims or open GitHub PRs. All 23 open GitHub issues have canonical PM comments; Dependabot/code-scanning/secret-scanning open inventories are empty. Grouping this injected-client defect with pm-zd46m7 as SDK-owned agent execution/context fidelity, preserving completed predecessor pm-cpja. Both CLI main and SDK runAction synthesize pm-extension before core author resolution; regression will cover real history and invocation isolation."
  "2026-10-20T07:10:13.904Z","harness:codex","Regression evidence: unchanged real CLI/native host test failed before the fix with pm-extension/asserted instead of workspace-actor/configured. The same test now passes environment/default/explicit/per-call cases, audited settings authors and scope restoration. It also exposed host author leaking into declared package flag validation; host controls now stay out of package options. Focused cohort82/82 passes. Full coverage/static and hosted acceptance remain pending; current production Sentry has zero recent/unresolved issues and required telemetry passes at2.36 percent with complete error codes."
  "2026-10-20T07:39:45.881Z","harness:codex","Final focused acceptance now passes197/197 across10 files, including native options.author overriding a client default, matching ctx.global.author, per-call item overrides and audited settings attribution. New tests live under focused extensions/read-output directories; no density cap or existing test deadline changed. Packed Node and Bun continuation journeys pass after the documented local npm discovery environment is provided."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-20T07:15:05.802Z","harness:codex",Injected clients must preserve absence of an author override until the normal resolver sees environment/workspace/harness inputs; supplying a synthetic default silently converts configured/detected identity into asserted history.
